# Error Handling & Standardization (US-52)
# ========================================
# The Gateway provides consistent error responses with:
# - Standard format: { statusCode, message, details, source, timestamp }
# - Proper HTTP status codes (400, 401, 502, 504, etc.)
# - Gateway errors distinguished by "source": "Gateway"
# - Circuit breaker (passive health checks) with 1-minute reactivation
# - Automatic failover when downstream services fail
#
# Error Response Example:
# {
#   "statusCode": 502,
#   "message": "Service unavailable",
#   "details": "Unable to reach downstream service",
#   "source": "Gateway",
